{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54289","headline":"题鸣峯岩 一 · 郑良士","name":"题鸣峯岩 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卓锡栖云老道翁，结茅甃塔万山中。\n石炉昼夜香腾雾，琪树春秋翠插空。\n菜长给孤园值雨，藤摆罗汉谷生风。\n禅闻寂寞无人到，尘世喧嚣总不同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑良士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}